<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2015/06/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <!-- Required -->
    <id>obelisk-cli</id>
    <version>1.1.0</version>
    <title>Obelisk CLI</title>
    <authors>OneDev PH</authors>
    <description>
Obelisk CLI is an AI-powered automated tech lead for modern codebases. It acts as a final gatekeeper for your project, evaluating project integrity, security, and architectural health using deep static analysis, native code parsing, and LLM intelligence.

## Features

- **Security Shield**: Deep-scans for hardcoded secrets, API keys, and security vulnerabilities
- **Code Quality**: Native syntax checking, cyclomatic complexity analysis, and technical debt tracking
- **AI Analysis**: Health scores (A-F), vibe checks, and plain-English summaries powered by Google Gemini
- **Multiple Modes**: Interactive TUI, local dashboard, and headless CI/CD mode
- **Git Integration**: Pre-push hooks to block commits with critical issues
- **Report Generation**: Automatic markdown/text reports with timestamps

## Usage

After installation, run:
- `obelisk` - Launch interactive TUI
- `obelisk check` - Run health check with visual dashboard
- `obelisk scan` - Headless mode for CI/CD pipelines
- `obelisk config` - Manage configuration
- `obelisk --help` - Show all commands

Built with IBM Bob IDE for the IBM Bob Hackathon 2026.
    </description>

